{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國8個州周三（14日）控告人工智能公司OpenAI，指公司的ChatGPT危害民眾，包括教唆青少年傷害自己或他人。</p><p>興訟州份要求OpenAI支付民事賠償、修改ChatGPT，以及在確保其AI模型符合人類價值觀前，不得開發可自我升級的模型。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:35.838412+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T04:00:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T16:17:40.279043+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416436+00:00","content_hash":"79b275f669967cf4e5e3e9125a3385da3a19ea8d42419582320428faa9998a10","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}